# GitOps platform repository

Scaffolded by [fluxboost](https://github.com/haney-oliver/fluxboost) for
provider **{{ .C.Provider }}** against flux **{{ .FluxVersion }}**.

## Layout

```
clusters/<env>/        Flux entry points (flux bootstrap targets clusters/<env>)
  flux-system/         written by `flux bootstrap`
  infra/               applies infra/overlays/<env> with substitution values
  tenants/, apps/      wired lazily by `fluxboost tenant add` / `fluxboost app add`
infra/
  overlays/<env>/      namespaces + one Flux Kustomization per platform service
  services/<svc>/      service manifests: _base/ shared, <env>/ overlay
tenants/<name>/        tenant RBAC + tenant-owned app tree
apps/services/<name>/  application manifests
fluxboost.yaml         choices made at init time; read by later fluxboost commands
```

